(Fixture library for plan 294 findings 19/20. Built with --shared, which
emits libtkit.lib beside libtkit.so. The .so is always correct; the PoCs
tamper only with the .lib's declared types.)

Library tkit version "1.0".

To 'give text'.
  Return a text, "abc".

To 'give number'.
  Return a number, 42.
